rtiers\n- ✓ Seven colored rooms described\n- ✓ Ebony clock motif included\n- ✓ Midnight confrontation with the masked figure\n- ✓ Prince's death in the black chamber\n- ✓ Revelation that figure is empty (\"an empty shell\")\n- Minor issue: \"prince confronts the intruder with a dagger\" and \"chased into the black chamber\" - actually Prospero pursued the figure through all seven rooms before confronting in black room\n\n**Score: 9/10** (excellent summary, minor sequence detail)\n\n---\n\n### 2.5 Pronunciation Guide (Weight: 10%)\n\n**Good entries:**\n- \"Prospero\" - /prəˈspɪrəʊ/ (Italian origin, correct)\n- \"mummer\" - /ˈmʌmər/ (correct definition provided)\n- \"improvisatori\" - Italian plural, correctly flagged as foreign/archaic\n- \"habiliments\" - archaic, correctly flagged\n- \"cerements\" - grave clothes, appropriately flagged\n- Homographs correctly identified: \"live\", \"close\", \"produce\", \"deliberate\"\n\n**False positives (common English words that shouldn't be flagged):**\n- \"dauntless\" - common English word\n- \"chiming\" - common English\n- \"magnificence\" - common English\n- \"buffoons\" - common English\n- \"provisioned\" - common English\n- \"glaringly\" - common English\n- \"light-hearted\" - compound, standard English\n- \"depopulated\" - standard English\n- \"blood-tinted\", \"blood-colored\", \"corpse-like\" - compound adjectives, standard patterns\n\n73 total pronunciation entries is excessive for a ~2500 word text. About 35-40% appear to be false positives.\n\n**Score: 6/10** (good coverage of genuinely unusual words, but too many false positives)\n\n---\n\n### 2.6 HTML Presentation (Weight: 10%)\n\n**Observed:**\n- Tab navigation works (Overview, Characters, Pronunciations, Summaries, Glossary)\n- Character confidence filters present\n- Pronunciation views toggle (By Type / By Chapter)\n- Search functionality for pronunciations\n- Print styles defined\n- Mobile responsive design\n- Dark theme with good contrast\n\n**Minor issues:**\n- The character profile cards don't show the structured profile data (because it's null)\n\n**Score: 8/10** (functional, well-organized, minor gap in profile display)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Calculate Overall Score\n\n```\nOverall = (\n    Structure × 0.20 +\n    Characters × 0.25 +\n    Profiles × 0.15 +\n    Summaries × 0.20 +\n    Pronunciation × 0.10 +\n    Presentation × 0.10\n)\n\n= (10 × 0.20) + (7 × 0.25) + (6 × 0.15) + (9 × 0.20) + (6 × 0.10) + (8 × 0.10)\n= 2.0 + 1.75 + 0.90 + 1.80 + 0.60 + 0.80\n= 7.85/10\n```\n\n**Overall Score: 7.85/10** (threshold: 8.0)\n\n## 4. Result: FAIL (Gap: 0.15 points)\n\nThe adaptive profile threshold fix WORKED - profiles are now being generated (26.65s, 3 LLM calls, 2 items). However, the profiles are being stored in `descriptions` array rather than the structured `appearance`, `personality`, `voice_guidance` fields.\n\nNow let me update the state files:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2945,"cache_read_input_tokens":64451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2945,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae045d92-9d9b-4a23-bbdf-47430e27ab20","uuid":"9ce8d738-f045-40f5-b93f-aa8e2aa07e76"}
